{"id":"1427940d1339037e","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-skolem-conservativity.md","title":"Conservativity of Skolem Expansion","display":"thm-skolem-conservativity — Conservativity of Skolem Expansion","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-skolem-conservativity","aliases":["17-thm-skolem-conservativity"],"display":"thm-skolem-conservativity — Conservativity of Skolem Expansion","depends_on":["[[17-df-reduct]]","[[17-df-skolem-expansion]]","[[17-df-theory-properties]]","[[17-df-sentence]]"],"source_section":"3.3","source_result":"Local sentence-conservativity consequence of Proposition 3.3.1(i)","source_pages_print":[164],"source_pages_djvu":[180],"source_verification":"expansion proof compared in supplied OCR; conservativity derived locally by reducts","label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-thm-2.3.3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-skolem-conservativity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-skolem-conservativity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-skolem-conservativity — Conservativity of Skolem Expansion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f48c896e5c0651df\" href=\"?note=f48c896e5c0651df\" title=\"17-df-reduct\">17-df-reduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fe3b669b17d273d8\" href=\"?note=fe3b669b17d273d8\" title=\"17-df-skolem-expansion\">17-df-skolem-expansion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.3"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Local sentence-conservativity consequence of Proposition 3.3.1(i)"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>164</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>180</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"expansion proof compared in supplied OCR; conservativity derived locally by reducts"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-2.3.3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\">\\(T^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\\)</span> (Skolem expansion, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fe3b669b17d273d8\" href=\"?note=fe3b669b17d273d8\" title=\"17-df-skolem-expansion\">17-df-skolem-expansion</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (semantic consequence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\n\\Bigl(\nT^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\\models\\sigma\n\\leftrightarrow\nT\\models\\sigma\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\n\\Bigl(\nT^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\\models\\sigma\n\\leftrightarrow\nT\\models\\sigma\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every model of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> admits an expansion to a model of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\">\\(T^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\\)</span>; the reduct operation is <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f48c896e5c0651df\" href=\"?note=f48c896e5c0651df\" title=\"17-df-reduct\">17-df-reduct</a>. Therefore no new sentence in the original language follows semantically.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-reduct","status":"resolved","id":"f48c896e5c0651df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-reduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-skolem-expansion","status":"resolved","id":"fe3b669b17d273d8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-skolem-expansion]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-theory-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-skolem-expansion","status":"resolved","id":"fe3b669b17d273d8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T^{\\mathrm{Sk}}$ (Skolem expansion, see [[17-df-skolem-expansion]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ ($L$-sentence, see [[17-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\models$ (semantic consequence, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-reduct","status":"resolved","id":"f48c896e5c0651df","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Every model of $T$ admits an expansion to a model of $T^{\\mathrm{Sk}}$; the reduct operation is [[17-df-reduct]]. Therefore no new sentence in the original language follows semantically.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\mathrm{Sk}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\n\\Bigl(\nT^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\\models\\sigma\n\\leftrightarrow\nT\\models\\sigma\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\mathrm{Sk}}","display":false}],"bytes":1344,"backlinks":[{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-222","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-thm-aleph-one-categoricity-consequences]]\n[[17-thm-atomic-model-existence]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability-satisfaction-form]]\n[[17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-chain-theory-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-compactness]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-equivalents]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-henkin-form]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-ultraproduct-form]]\n[[17-thm-completeness-characterization]]\n[[17-thm-countable-back-and-forth]]\n[[17-thm-countable-omitting-types]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation-common-language